{
 "title": "Checking Invoice Reconciliation Details in SAP Ariba Buying and Invoicing",
 "body": "<!DOCTYPE html\n  SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\" dir=\"ltr\"><head><title>Checking Invoice Reconciliation Details in SAP Ariba Buying and Invoicing</title><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"abstract\" content=\"When viewing an invoice in guided buying, you can click a link to check the progress and details of reconciliation in SAP Ariba Buying and Invoicing.\"><meta name=\"description\" content=\"When viewing an invoice in guided buying, you can click a link to check the progress and details of reconciliation in SAP Ariba Buying and Invoicing.\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"screen,projection\" href=\"/resource/css/style-v2.css\"><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"js/sap-strings.js\"></script></head><body class=\"en-us sap-light centered navigation-default enumeration-disabled collapsify-enabled\"><div id=\"d4h5-main-container\" class=\"container_12\" role=\"application\"><div id=\"d4h5-section-container\" class=\"grid_12\"><div id=\"d4h5-main-content\" class=\"grid_8 alpha omega\"><section><div class=\"page task  - topic-topic task-task \" id=\"loiob764c51cce8a4245880cf9f062e2e337\"><h1 class=\"title topictitle1\">Checking Invoice Reconciliation Details in <span class=\"ph\" translate=\"no\">SAP Ariba Buying and\nInvoicing</span></h1><div class=\"body taskbody\"><p class=\"shortdesc\">When viewing an invoice in guided buying, you can click a link to check the progress\nand details of reconciliation in <span class=\"ph\" translate=\"no\">SAP Ariba Buying and\nInvoicing</span>.</p>\n<div class=\"section prereq p\" id=\"loiob764c51cce8a4245880cf9f062e2e337__prereq_kgz_w24_qwb\"><div class=\"tasklabel\"><h2 class=\"sectiontitle tasklabel\">Prerequisites</h2></div>\n<p class=\"p\">Your administrator must enable the parameter,\n<samp class=\"ph codeph\">PARAM_ENABLE_EDIT_AND_APPROVAL_OF_INVOICES</samp>. For more information\nsee, <a class=\"xref\" href=\"ef4c199e9e2b401a8211585084d4d916.html\" title=\"Guided buying parameters determine how specific processes and functions work in guided buying.\">Guided Buying Parameters</a>.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section context\" id=\"loiob764c51cce8a4245880cf9f062e2e337__context_fll_ymh_51c\"><span id=\"steps\" class=\"anchor\"></span><div class=\"tasklabel\"><h2 class=\"sectiontitle tasklabel\">Context</h2></div>\n<p class=\"p\">You can quickly navigate from guided buying to <span class=\"ph\" translate=\"no\">SAP Ariba Buying and\nInvoicing</span> to find invoice reconciliation\ndetails or make changes to the IR.</p>\n</div>\n<section class=\"section procedure\"><span id=\"steps\" class=\"anchor\"></span><div class=\"ol steps tasklabel\"><h2 class=\"sectiontitle tasklabel\">Procedure</h2></div><ol class=\"ol steps\"><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">To find the invoice, open <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Your Requests</span> from the home\npage.</span>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">Choose <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Invoice requests</span>.</span>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">Use any of the following ways to find an invoice:</span>\n<div class=\"itemgroup info\">\n<ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loiob764c51cce8a4245880cf9f062e2e337__ul_w4q_g4h_51c\">\n<li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Invoice ID</span></p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Invoice number</span></p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Invoice title</span></p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\"> Supplier name</span></p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Invoice status</span></p></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">Click the invoice to view the details.</span>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">To view the invoice reconciliation details in <span class=\"ph\" translate=\"no\">SAP Ariba Buying and\nInvoicing</span>, click the IR document link\nthat begins with \"IR\", as shown in the following figure.</span>\n<div class=\"itemgroup info\">\n<div class=\"fig fignone\" id=\"loiob764c51cce8a4245880cf9f062e2e337__fig_u1x_fgf_nvb\"><div class=\"figbody\">\n<img class=\"inline\" id=\"loiob764c51cce8a4245880cf9f062e2e337__image_sqc_nm2_t1c\" src=\"loio080f7772435040ab8bc38ec8831c1989_LowRes.jpg\">\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">(Optional) To perform any reconciliation activities, click\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Open</span>.</span>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">To return to the invoice in guided buying, do one of the following: </span>\n<ul class=\"ul choices\" id=\"loiob764c51cce8a4245880cf9f062e2e337__choices_k4p_hfh_bbc\">\n<li class=\"li choice\"><p>If you viewed the IR, click the back button (<span class=\"SAP-icons-V5\"></span>) to return to guided buying.</p></li>\n<li class=\"li choice\"><p>If you opened the IR, click <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Exit</span>, and then click the\nback button (<span class=\"SAP-icons-V5\"></span>) to return to guided buying. </p></li>\n<li class=\"li choice\"><p>If you <span class=\"ph emphasis emphasis\">approved</span> or <span class=\"ph emphasis emphasis\">saved</span> the IR,\nclick the <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Invoice ID</span> to return to guided buying.</p></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"itemgroup info\">\n<p class=\"p\">If you're not returned to guided buying, open guided buying manually.</p>\n</div>\n</li></ol></section>\n</div></div></section><div class=\"clear\"></div>\n</div></div></div></body></html>"
}